## Common Anti-Patterns

- ❌ Not using Vector Search for RAG → ✅ Use Databricks Vector Search with Delta Sync
- ❌ Hardcoded prompts in code → ✅ Version control and log prompts with MLflow
- ❌ No input validation → ✅ Implement guardrails for prompt injection and PII
- ❌ Not citing sources in RAG → ✅ Always return source documents with answers
- ❌ Using wrong embedding model → ✅ Choose embedding model based on domain and language
- ❌ No LLM evaluation → ✅ Track relevance, faithfulness, toxicity, and bias metrics
- ❌ Expensive models for simple tasks → ✅ Use Agent Bricks auto-optimization

